    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Wield the Power of Death Against the Scourge</p></blockquote><p>The Oath of the Ebon Blade unites the free death knights of Azeroth. No longer under the Lich King's direct control, they still serve Bolvar Fordragon—first as agents of the new Lich King, and, since the destruction of the Helm of Domination, as troops devoted to halting the spread of the Scourge.</p><h3>Oath of the Ebon Blade Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.pAGkBn67ukqHaUL9]{Death Coil}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.k8vGhK3XBMViPhST]{Runic Smite}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Immd9IvbZCS83TBc]{Oath of the Ebon Blade Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.RsgEU4t5ATLRUqEq]{Runeforging}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.4sNPt8llXw0H6S5l]{Runic Power}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ZAEskjJsBYdNd9Zd]{Faithful Steed}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.pVaG0DEJZIGReYyB]{Aura of Deathly Endurance}</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.xhnzcCB7E84UYrvR]{Runic Strikes}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.t2PpJJvUfFafDKOf]{Improved Death Coil}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.HZMOpyC4lDgZ4c0V]{Runic Mastery}</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.SN9z54PeZ0CJb4vh]{Aspect of the Horsemen}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Oath of the Ebon Blade Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Paladin Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.AHt4Fah8Iv2RUCUa]{Death Grip}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.